Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.56,0:01:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乃大雄是也
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.07,0:01:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说错了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乃从石头里蹦出来的石猴 孙悟空是也
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:24.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,筋斗云,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以用筋斗云飞十万八千里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.96,0:01:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可以使用七十二变
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论是什麽样的坏人都能把他们打的七零八落
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在是太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏人出现了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.41,0:01:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大坏蛋,看你们往哪跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我们记住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.83,0:01:59.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:02.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.25,0:02:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.87,0:02:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:17.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是什麽哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是住在西方极乐世界的释迦牟尼佛祖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,释迦牟尼佛祖?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找我要做什麽?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的口气真是狂妄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是当然罗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我不会拉单杠也不会跳木马
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:33.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过只要一跳上我的筋斗云
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就可以马上飞到天涯海角
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你可以飞过我的手掌心吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也叫做手掌心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那根本就是土豆嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要仔细看好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.91,0:02:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就飞到宇宙的尽头让你瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:55.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就要飞过银河系了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞到这里应该就差不多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:12.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麽行星啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在上面画个标记当证据吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,画个圈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再画个圈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再画个嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,释迦牟尼佛祖他一定会吓一跳的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎麽可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:48.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来你的力量不过如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为的那颗行星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是我的手掌心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这只愚蠢的猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:08.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你放我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,释迦牟尼佛祖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底想怎麽样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不爱念书
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又不听妈妈的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且又爱哭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还老是喜欢欺负哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了改掉这些恶习
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.23,0:04:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让你在这里悔改五百年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五百年?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.01,0:04:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五百年後会有一位叫做玄奘的法师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:34.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了到天竺取经而路过此地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就陪他一道去取经
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後修行你自己吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要,我才不要呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我出去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.47,0:05:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玄奘法师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你在说什麽啊\n该你出场了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:03.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快一点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然躲在这打瞌睡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:09.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽连阿福和技安都来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点上去啊不快一点的话\n我会打你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乃从石头里蹦出来的石猴\n孙悟空是也
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽可能让你演孙悟空呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你的角色是村人甲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该要说"救命啊"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这麽一句而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乾脆把大雄的戏份删掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽会这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的平行西游记
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:04.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多好的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:06.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是能办到该多好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的梦 这样的梦 有好多好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个一个一个地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都能实现
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那不可思议的小口袋 为我实现
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想自由地 在天空飞翔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"给你！这是竹蜻蜓"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:31.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.23,0:06:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎麽可以擅自删台词呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:06.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元开同学\n这剧本是你写的你有什麽看法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是只有一句对白也是很重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过今天的时间已经不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们从第十四场戏开始排练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就从……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空成为唐三藏的弟子这段开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好心的法师\n求你救救我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你愿意跟我一起到天竺的话\n我就放你出来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你是要到天竺或是天涯海角\n我都愿意跟你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的吗\n你可不要骗我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麽会骗你呢\n我在这里已经待很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:39.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌，好不容易在迎新会上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有机会参加西游记的演出的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在却变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被压在石头下五百年真是累惨我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.47,0:07:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空这个角色比较适应我演的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，你还是比较适合演猪八戒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这话什麽意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:07:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什麽啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好，你们演得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:01.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猪妖猪八戒的出场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:08.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猪，换猪出场了\n现在该猪妖出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少罗嗦\n好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:15.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要说什麽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.34,0:08:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是一个看起来令人垂涎的女孩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是一个看起来令人垂涎的乳猪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为是个女孩原来是一只猴子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为是只乳猪原来是一出木衫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个残害良家妇女的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天一定要收拾你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你打得赢我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害，你这只猪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然叫我猪\n你以为你功课好就很了不起吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下，等一下啦技安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猪八戒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:50.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猪八戒要是打倒孙悟空\n那整个戏就全乱了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才说我比较适合演孙悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人适合的角色个性不同啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:09:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊所以你最适合演河怪沙悟净了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以後都不理你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实应该让最像真的孙悟空的人\n来扮演这个角色的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的孙悟空？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，根本就没有真正的孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的,一定有的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不过是个虚构的故事\n所以孙悟空不可能存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上就去证明给你们看\n你们等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证实？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真正的孙悟空长得和我一模一样的话\n这个角色就要给我演喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.91,0:09:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们等着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:38.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不要到动物园找只猴子\n告诉我们你们长得很像啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我们是不会让你演的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.18,0:09:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有的，一定有孙悟空的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:00.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:01.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦……A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什麽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的机器喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.38,0:10:22.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能再待在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:35.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该到什麽时代的什麽地方去才好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.94,0:10:38.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请告诉我要前往的时代和地点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.98,0:10:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光机居然会说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我已安装了语音功能的装置了\n请告诉我你的需求吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我想去找孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空，我明白了\N查找资料中……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球历史上没有这个人的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，孙悟空是猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猴子？\n我没有猴子的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麽你查查三藏法师\n他是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师，我明白了\n查找资料中……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距今大约一千三百五十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从中国出发到印度取经的和尚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.97,0:11:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对，就是这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要到他到印度旅行时的这段时期
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个时候孙悟空应该和他在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,629年9月3日从长安出发
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这段漫长的旅行历经十九年\n我们要选那一段时间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便吧，大概找一段时间就行了\n接下来我可以在慢慢找
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:42.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没想到大雄那小子真的笨到那种程度
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:55.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是三藏法师
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是生於七世纪时的中国真正的人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那该不会真的有孙悟空吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:03.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然没有，那只是後来的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了让故事更有趣而加入的虚构人物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过那个时候要做长途旅行\n一定很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.34,0:12:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是当然的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.47,0:12:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为当时没有汽车和飞机啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜\n明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就要到西元636年8月
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚洲中央的大沙漠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.53,0:12:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师会经过那里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能有正负24小时的差距
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽这麽差劲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这已经是电脑的极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好热啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师真的会经过这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据电脑的计算是会通过的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:10.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先去找找看再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎麽找啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来好像找不到的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:33.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看我还是放弃回家去好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是飞机吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个时代该不会有飞机才对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是……是孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:14:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有，真的有孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快回去告诉大家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师，三藏法师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽啊，他不是三藏法师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，你振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水……我要喝水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:30.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水……\n这里怎麽可能会有水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:39.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这里有没有水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的储备箱里有存放的一点紧急用水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.07,0:14:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把水拿来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好喝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我\n这是你第二次救我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，我还要赶路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:16.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个我……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了我问你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问还有什麽事情吗，孙悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什麽\n你要小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道我长得跟孙悟空一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会见\n我会带大家一起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终於撑到最後一关了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是最後一关\n这里果然有大怪兽守住城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，再加把劲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.98,0:16:44.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尝尝我哆啦A梦国王宝剑的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:55.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你哆啦A梦国王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经闯过了游戏的所有关卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.45,0:17:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直相信你会来救我的\n你果然是天神派来的勇士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要客气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.71,0:17:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你，哆啦A梦国王
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:32.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等大雄回来\n我们可以一起玩个双打的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他一定会很高兴的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的书包怎麽会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了，找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到谁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还用问吗\n当然是孙悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去告诉大家这个好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了\n等一下，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:10.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家才想跟他一起玩这个刚才未来百货公司\n送来的虚拟实境游戏机呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家都在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.91,0:18:26.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.22,0:18:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到孙悟空了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不刚相信
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种事只有在漫画才会出现吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的而且他长得跟我一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎麽可能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你有照片可以证明吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是亲眼看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:43.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我看你是做梦梦到的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们大家现在一起去看看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福，你耳朵过来一下\n做什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.23,0:18:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:53.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空是神话故事里的虚拟人物耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到连宜静也要怀疑我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:19:00.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你真的看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.52,0:19:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你说谎的话怎麽办
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.77,0:19:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦的道具全部任我们使用\n可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.55,0:19:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部任你们使用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麽样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.95,0:19:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这麽说孙悟空也有戴眼镜罗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真的有戴眼镜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家怎麽都来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.43,0:19:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太巧了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:36.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦你也跟我们一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在正要去买铜锣烧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.58,0:19:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个待会再买啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧，去吧\n要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧\n一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.61,0:19:43.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.11,0:19:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在西游记之旅即将开始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.51,0:19:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西游记？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点，快点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.07,0:19:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这究竟是怎麽回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:55.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦也一起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我们到刚才的时间地点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.36,0:20:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为时间会有正负24小时的差距
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.90,0:20:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是这样的话不就见不到孙悟空了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这已经是电脑的最大极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别罗嗦了快点给我马上出发
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:18.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.62,0:20:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给它装上自动装置之後动作就变得粗暴了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里跟上次来的地方根本就不一样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.19,0:20:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有我一直强调这是电脑的最大极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，孙悟空到底在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才我一个人来的时候\n我真的看到孙悟空了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.91,0:20:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:20:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该不会跑到奇怪的地方来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.58,0:21:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快点躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快躲起来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.35,0:21:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想\n这应该就是中国唐朝时的强盗集团吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强盗集团
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄\n这究竟是怎麽回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.89,0:21:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为技安他们说想亲眼看看孙悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.46,0:21:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽，想看看孙悟空？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.65,0:21:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的亲眼看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且後来又来了一个小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还叫我孙悟空呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真的这麽叫你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.65,0:21:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:22:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄从你什麽时候听得懂中国话了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.69,0:22:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又没有吃翻译果冻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽可能会听得懂中国小男孩说的话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.21,0:22:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.07,0:22:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任他们随意使用我的道具
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.49,0:22:24.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我真的很有自信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.53,0:22:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麽可以擅自答应他们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.66,0:22:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.93,0:22:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.67,0:22:44.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想再遇到这样的危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.14,0:22:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点让我看到孙悟空吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.97,0:22:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要急嘛，先看看情况再说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少罗嗦\n你们过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.92,0:22:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.29,0:23:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.42,0:23:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽事，什麽事啊\n哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:06.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.06,0:23:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很可能是三藏法师和他的随从
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.17,0:23:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们过去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.15,0:23:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等，这样太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.42,0:23:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这里有个好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『间谍卫星』
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,STOP
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再接近一点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.55,0:23:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是旅行中的和尚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.71,0:23:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再靠近一点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.72,0:23:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是三藏法师
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.37,0:23:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才在电脑萤幕上见过这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.27,0:23:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:49.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到他跟想像中的不一样\n看起来强壮多了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.73,0:23:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是当然的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.14,0:23:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这是一段很艰辛的旅程啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.49,0:23:55.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就说过有这个人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.92,0:24:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄三藏法师是真实存在的人物\n所以有这个人是很正常的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.40,0:24:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空不是应该陪三藏法师去取经的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.19,0:24:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.95,0:24:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是神话故事摆了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有猪八戒和沙悟净也都是虚构的人物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.77,0:24:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你可要信守你的诺言喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.45,0:24:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.48,0:24:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在看到的是真正的三藏法师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\n我们现在正在目睹历史上的重要一页
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.63,0:24:31.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太令人感动了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.16,0:24:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在怎麽办，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.37,0:24:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们能找到那个男孩子的话就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:45.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在说这个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.39,0:24:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了\n我们现在只好这麽做了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.18,0:24:54.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是刚才放在我房间的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.62,0:24:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，这就是虚拟实境游戏机
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.27,0:24:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点进去里面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.44,0:25:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会怎麽样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.75,0:25:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别问那麽多了快趁大家还没有发现的时候进去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.49,0:25:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西游记……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.29,0:25:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.85,0:25:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你先暂时听电脑的吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.37,0:25:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多久啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.80,0:25:18.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到虚拟实境游戏机
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.18,0:25:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们为您选择适合您的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.11,0:25:29.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我变成孙悟空了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.32,0:25:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,筋斗云
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.33,0:25:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有如意棒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.76,0:25:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道这些东西是不是真的都可以用
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.83,0:25:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您可以随心所欲地使用筋斗云
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.14,0:25:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你自己本身也有七十二般变化\n绝对不会有变不出来的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.19,0:25:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麽，现在游戏就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.90,0:25:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你好好地享受这一场游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.34,0:26:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太美妙了\n好像在做梦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.89,0:26:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是齐天大圣孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.76,0:26:15.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这麽快就有妖怪出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.74,0:26:21.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.92,0:26:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.04,0:26:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.23,0:26:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.64,0:26:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.01,0:26:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.68,0:26:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把游戏机打开了\n你马上出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.78,0:26:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.54,0:26:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没将妖怪全部打倒耶
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.16,0:26:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏先玩到这里为止你快点用这个样子出来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.54,0:26:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话技安他们就会相信你的话了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.82,0:26:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此\n我差点就忘了你真聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.40,0:27:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁大家还没有发现\n动作快一点，快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.98,0:27:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄\n你必须把自己当作真正的孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.39,0:27:09.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了吗\n我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.36,0:27:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到外面来之後你也可以像在游戏机里一样行动自如
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.18,0:27:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你可以放心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.81,0:27:15.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗，真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.77,0:27:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄不要太放松了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.78,0:27:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先出去通知大家然後你再从那里飞出来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家，悟空出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.17,0:27:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.93,0:27:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.31,0:27:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.27,0:27:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.65,0:27:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶\n是孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.14,0:27:50.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过他为什麽要背对我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.36,0:27:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能是不好意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.22,0:27:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好帅，孙悟空\n请你看这边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.82,0:27:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.68,0:28:02.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他听得懂日语耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.05,0:28:05.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他是齐天大圣啊这点小事当然难不倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.65,0:28:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真的是孙悟空吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.16,0:28:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乃真正的孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.84,0:28:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟大雄长得一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.27,0:28:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.68,0:28:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了，他一定是真的孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.77,0:28:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.37,0:28:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉下来了\n他这样真的可以打妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，大雄呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.88,0:28:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那里尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.32,0:28:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜孙悟空好不容易出现了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.17,0:28:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思惭愧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.06,0:28:58.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定很忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.08,0:29:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会啊，我也不是很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.68,0:29:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定很忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.66,0:29:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的不忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.16,0:29:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过三藏法师已经往那边走了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.07,0:29:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.19,0:29:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个孙悟空……\n我可以跟你握个手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.58,0:29:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好，我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.52,0:29:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行，宜静才可以
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.58,0:29:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，既然这样的话\n让你们看看我的拿手绝活
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.46,0:29:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先让这支如意棒变大
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.04,0:29:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.32,0:29:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空，你振作一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.71,0:29:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快救救我啊\n好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.64,0:29:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要紧吧哪有这麽笨的孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.74,0:29:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快救救我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.97,0:29:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.32,0:29:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.53,0:30:02.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一二三，用力
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.29,0:30:04.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.34,0:30:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，如意棒变小
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.59,0:30:31.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始这样就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.63,0:30:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麽，我还有很多事要忙\n下次再找你们玩吧再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.46,0:30:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\n加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.35,0:30:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.39,0:30:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.87,0:30:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.24,0:30:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.13,0:30:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的我就知道是这麽回事\n我刚才就一直在怀疑了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.49,0:30:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你还记得我们的约定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.70,0:31:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快点回去\n一起玩刚才那个虚拟实境游戏机
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.11,0:31:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说是吧，阿福\n真是太令人期待了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.18,0:31:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，我不是交代过你了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.92,0:31:20.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦每次拿出来的道具\n都没有什麽好结果
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.66,0:31:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只会把责任推给道具
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.90,0:31:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你没有眼光挑选道具
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.35,0:31:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这麽说你这个人就简直是没救了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.04,0:31:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，我是没救了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.21,0:31:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把刚才那个道具拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.39,0:31:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道，我知道\n真拿你没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.16,0:31:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要玩什麽游戏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.98,0:32:04.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是西游记啊\n而且我要演孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.01,0:32:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.37,0:32:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我演别的也可以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.68,0:32:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都站上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.63,0:32:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你也跟我们一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.13,0:32:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.56,0:32:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正大雄可以扮演村人甲的角色啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.95,0:32:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏就要开始了\n你们要听从机器的指挥
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.13,0:32:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.54,0:32:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.13,0:32:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是气死人了这个任性的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.21,0:32:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.05,0:32:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请我为各位选择适合各人的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.01,0:32:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,服装已经换好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.77,0:32:59.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是齐天大圣孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.29,0:33:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.65,0:33:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，这究竟是怎麽回事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.45,0:33:05.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道啊这是电脑决定的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.85,0:33:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就说技安你还是比较适合当猪八戒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.81,0:33:12.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶，人家想当孙悟空嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.42,0:33:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八戒，注意你的言行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.51,0:33:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇塞宜静已经完全变成三藏法师了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.92,0:33:23.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麽现在游戏就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.84,0:33:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们好好地享受这一场游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.79,0:33:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有什麽随时会跑出来似的\n好可怕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.49,0:33:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.59,0:33:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我技安会保护大家的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.20,0:33:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是猪八戒吧\n少罗嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.09,0:33:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是好奇怪耶\n妖怪应该马上出现的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.34,0:33:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现了，不要退缩！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.60,0:33:55.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空，沙悟净
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.58,0:33:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.09,0:34:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎麽回事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.75,0:34:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏机该不会是坏掉了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.69,0:34:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.82,0:34:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才想问你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.62,0:34:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是已经玩过这个游戏了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.86,0:34:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.05,0:34:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师你们终於通过这游戏的所有关卡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.26,0:34:22.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来到天竺了希望下次我们有机会再见
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.44,0:34:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经结束了\n连一只妖怪也没有出现耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.87,0:34:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不觉得这个游戏机怪怪的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.17,0:34:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.35,0:34:42.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们动作真快，很好玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.46,0:34:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里好玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.68,0:34:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们根本就连一只妖怪也没有遇到
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.21,0:34:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.00,0:34:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有其他的游戏了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.72,0:34:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.75,0:34:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天已经不早了\n明天再继续玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.37,0:34:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.47,0:34:58.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈会担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.11,0:35:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了\n大雄，明天学校见
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.55,0:35:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.48,0:35:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦\n明天也要任我们使用喔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.50,0:35:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.08,0:35:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了啦，真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.74,0:35:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.70,0:35:19.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是大雄你害的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.70,0:35:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好怪异的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.75,0:35:42.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，哆啦A梦\n吃饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.05,0:35:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.90,0:35:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.26,0:35:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.51,0:36:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个炸鸡块好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.99,0:36:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶，真的很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.49,0:36:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸，吃饭的时候不要看报纸
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.38,0:36:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，爸……爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.05,0:36:20.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.83,0:36:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麽了，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.60,0:36:27.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没……什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.94,0:36:31.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个炸鸡块真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.42,0:36:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.89,0:36:36.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是用大雄最喜欢的青蛙肉和蛇肉去炸的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.26,0:36:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让大家久等了这是爸爸最喜欢的\n蜥蜴大补汤
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.97,0:36:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,味道闻起来真不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.46,0:36:50.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃饱了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.32,0:36:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇怪的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.16,0:36:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是怎麽了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.65,0:37:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有什麽鬼怪
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.33,0:37:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什麽地方出了错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.14,0:37:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.98,0:37:26.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.92,0:37:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想说什麽，哆啦A梦\n大雄你又想说什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.54,0:37:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦你现说
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.97,0:37:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你为什麽不先说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.94,0:37:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱逞强
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.39,0:37:50.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去上学了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.37,0:38:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你愿意换取心脏以後为妖怪世界尽一份力的话
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.79,0:38:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就原谅你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.17,0:38:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，牛魔王
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.57,0:38:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以後我会为妖怪世界尽心尽力的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.63,0:38:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.46,0:38:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起把唐三藏给吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.27,0:38:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静，该你上场了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.06,0:38:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是为什麽唐三藏会被吃掉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.30,0:38:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是西游记耶\n最後邪恶的唐三藏被吃掉是当然的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.23,0:38:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有这麽荒诞的事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.94,0:38:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，哪有妖怪会战胜人类的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.90,0:38:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是当然的啊\n我从来没听说过妖怪会输给人类的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.43,0:38:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们四个今天是怎麽了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.91,0:38:52.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的人是你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.26,0:38:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎麽了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.67,0:38:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什麽故事结局一定都是人类灭亡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.59,0:39:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，出木衫今天好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.98,0:39:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是出木衫\n除了我们四个人以外大家都变的奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.14,0:39:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不这样的话\n我们妖怪要怎麽生存在这个世界上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.90,0:39:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有认真的排练吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.24,0:39:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话剧的排练进行的顺利吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.24,0:39:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师对你们这次的演出抱着很大的期望喔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.27,0:39:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.16,0:39:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边的四个人不愿意配合排练
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.04,0:39:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的\n我们只是说妖怪会战胜人类这样实在太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.49,0:39:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.61,0:39:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果三藏法师被吃掉的话\n这样的西游记不是很可笑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.02,0:39:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样有什麽可笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.74,0:39:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们究竟是什麽人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.47,0:39:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.08,0:39:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.83,0:39:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我……我也不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.44,0:39:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从早上就觉得事情太不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.39,0:40:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎麽回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.19,0:40:10.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从昨天晚上开始就觉得有点怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.77,0:40:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是从我们进入哆啦A梦的虚拟实境游戏机\n玩西游记的时候就开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.15,0:40:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错，这都是哆啦A梦害的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.15,0:40:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽这麽说
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.82,0:40:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之，我要回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.37,0:40:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.49,0:40:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你一定要和哆啦A梦把事情弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.48,0:40:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.25,0:40:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.28,0:40:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都要回家了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.06,0:40:32.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂~
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.74,0:40:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，回答我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.56,0:40:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.90,0:40:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻点，轻点
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.15,0:41:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦\n大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.03,0:41:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经知道了事情不太对劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.58,0:41:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们现在该怎麽办
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.27,0:41:10.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.77,0:41:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学校方面怎麽样了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.57,0:41:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了我们之外大家好像都已经变成妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.20,0:41:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静还说是不是因为我们进入那个游戏机\n所以事情才会变得这麽奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.40,0:41:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.72,0:41:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.83,0:41:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来了吧为什麽不说一声呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.25,0:41:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.89,0:41:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.49,0:41:37.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该不会又把零分考卷藏起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.05,0:41:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.24,0:41:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麽会这样做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.43,0:41:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要乖乖做功课喔，听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.20,0:41:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.29,0:41:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈怎麽会变成那个样子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.33,0:41:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，我们先到街上瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.21,0:41:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.24,0:42:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乍看起来和平常没有什麽两样
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.60,0:42:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过总觉得空气里弥漫着一股妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.16,0:42:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该不会进入妖怪的世界里了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.54,0:42:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该不会\n不然这里怎麽会有我们的家和学校呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.09,0:42:14.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不是很奇怪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.72,0:42:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那究竟是怎麽回事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.21,0:42:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.18,0:42:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里应该没有这样的塔才对啊\n我们靠近点看看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.35,0:42:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我啊，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.84,0:42:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈头上的角
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.51,0:42:59.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有变身成妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.51,0:43:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是因为那座塔让妖怪的世界慢慢入侵所造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.62,0:43:06.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.57,0:43:09.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西游记排练後来变成什麽样了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.49,0:43:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果很奇怪\n因为结局後来变成唐三藏被妖怪吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.83,0:43:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽，果然从那个时候开始历史就已经改变了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.56,0:43:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.06,0:43:21.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.08,0:43:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点，快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.89,0:43:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点嘛，快拿个什麽道具出来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.10,0:43:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了『蝙蝠克星枪』
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.11,0:43:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.14,0:43:54.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.30,0:43:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过他们为什麽要攻击我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.45,0:44:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想一定是因为他们知道你是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.72,0:44:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这麽说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.27,0:44:06.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的三个人也会有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.17,0:44:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\n好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.93,0:44:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.94,0:44:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.37,0:44:36.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈……妈妈她……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.69,0:44:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.96,0:44:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，我们还是先回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.17,0:44:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要出声
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.56,0:44:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.56,0:44:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.36,0:44:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.65,0:45:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,历史改变了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.02,0:45:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让别人知道我们是人类的话就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.74,0:45:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.40,0:45:09.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什麽事情会变成这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.12,0:45:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天我们不是搭乘时光机到唐朝去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.97,0:45:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候虚拟实境游戏机我一直开着
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.56,0:45:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西游记游戏软体里的妖怪\n一定是趁那时候跑到现实世界来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.27,0:45:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些妖怪们是被设定要吃掉唐三藏的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.43,0:45:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这麽说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.34,0:45:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话剧里唐三藏会被吃掉的结局……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.22,0:45:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.03,0:45:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这已经变成真实的历史了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.49,0:45:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麽，为什麽这里会变成这样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.52,0:45:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然唐三藏已经被吃掉了故事不就应该结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.76,0:45:49.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没有因此而消失反而慢慢进化
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.61,0:45:51.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们利用本身的妖术终於连整个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.73,0:45:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是这个地球也都陷入他们的魔掌之中
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.66,0:45:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後连历史也都被他们给支配了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.26,0:46:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什麽事情会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.82,0:46:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.60,0:46:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道我们没有办法回到原来的世界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.97,0:46:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，只有我们再度回到唐朝\n把妖怪们全部收服就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.94,0:46:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.23,0:46:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这麽说我们要真的演出西游记了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.83,0:46:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.35,0:46:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你说的这麽简单
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.78,0:46:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全部是因为你的道具不好\n所以事情才会变成这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.53,0:46:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.82,0:46:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算回到唐朝有什麽\n用对手可是称霸地球的妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.66,0:46:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎麽可能会赢嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.24,0:46:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是要你们跟妖怪们打架
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.54,0:46:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是要让妖怪们回到机器里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.49,0:46:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之，我们快点动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.13,0:46:50.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，既然对手是虚拟实境游戏机里的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.29,0:46:54.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麽我们也打扮成西游记里的人物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.51,0:46:55.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.44,0:46:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我还要当猪八戒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.23,0:46:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要继续当河怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.92,0:47:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在已经没有时间计较这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.10,0:47:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.80,0:47:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.11,0:47:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,楼上是不是有朋友来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.81,0:47:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有别人来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.88,0:47:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.53,0:47:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,功课做完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.74,0:47:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做完了的话就去帮妈妈买东西
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.05,0:47:17.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.02,0:47:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.82,0:47:20.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.25,0:47:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪了我是不是听错了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.89,0:47:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有被设定新的历史\n所以请自己用手动设定
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.98,0:47:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该没有改变很多你不能帮帮忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.16,0:47:45.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光乱流处於第一失重状态历史发生重大改变\n这是异常现象
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.22,0:47:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.94,0:47:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦，不要紧吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.94,0:47:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.80,0:49:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往那上面走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.51,0:50:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师这整座庙里都没有人烟
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.87,0:50:20.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也没有办法我们就先在这里休息一会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.42,0:50:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.08,0:50:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小杨
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.45,0:50:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在一起已经几天了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.39,0:50:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是，我已经跟你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.50,0:50:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到今天已经十天了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.08,0:50:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自我从长安出发以来已经过了一年
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.99,0:50:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道有多少弟子因为无法吃苦而离去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.96,0:50:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小杨
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.36,0:50:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.18,0:50:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里距离天竺还有一段很遥远的路程
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.08,0:50:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以吃得了苦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.83,0:50:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.56,0:51:00.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，我们也该出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.79,0:51:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.64,0:51:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金角，他就是唐三藏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.91,0:51:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该就是他了吧\n听说吃了他的肉可以长生不老呢，银角
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.70,0:52:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.90,0:52:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想应该差不多该到了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.16,0:52:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不要带我们到什麽奇怪的地方去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.29,0:52:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，我这里有一个好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.14,0:52:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『危险警报员』
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.61,0:52:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个有什麽用
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.29,0:52:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管在什麽地方只要有危险他都会通知我们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.36,0:52:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,例如说妖怪来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.51,0:52:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.22,0:52:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.31,0:52:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里怎麽没有妖怪呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.00,0:52:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会搞错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.60,0:52:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个风景
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.87,0:52:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里应该就是中国大陆的某一角不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.74,0:52:50.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.03,0:52:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『翻译果冻』
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.36,0:52:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.22,0:52:57.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定这里真的是唐朝吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.17,0:52:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.26,0:52:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里确定是中国大陆
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.88,0:53:01.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家会说中国话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.81,0:53:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连语言都不通怎麽办事\n对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.50,0:53:08.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\n谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.44,0:53:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.28,0:53:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.71,0:53:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.86,0:53:22.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.52,0:53:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看那边那不是三藏法师吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.00,0:53:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是他，那这一定是……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.36,0:53:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他们干的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.66,0:53:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.33,0:53:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在该上场将他们回收了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.57,0:53:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.54,0:53:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点把道具拿出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.84,0:53:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没告诉你们吗\n你们可以像在游戏中一样拥有一身的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.54,0:53:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.70,0:53:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什麽不早点说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.54,0:53:55.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,筋斗云
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.30,0:54:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好，真好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.30,0:54:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪避披风……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.79,0:54:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽还没有抓到唐三藏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.34,0:54:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到你们了，你们这些妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.82,0:54:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们该不会是金角银角吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.93,0:54:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.85,0:54:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪了，你们不认识我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.47,0:54:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁认识你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.76,0:54:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点报上名来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.78,0:54:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是平常那个胆小的大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.30,0:54:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是齐天大圣孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.19,0:54:34.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.21,0:54:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有他的夥伴哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.35,0:54:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猪八戒
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.81,0:54:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是沙悟净
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.27,0:54:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌，只有大雄一个人当英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.67,0:54:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.23,0:54:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，你们还是乖乖地……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.31,0:54:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到虚拟实境游戏机里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.77,0:54:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽\n可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.18,0:54:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我收拾你们
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.33,0:54:55.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了，来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.60,0:55:07.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要过来，不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.61,0:55:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.90,0:55:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点进虚拟实境游戏机里去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.73,0:55:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什麽啊你这个短腿的醉狸猫
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.63,0:55:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是狸猫
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.90,0:55:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是说过我叫做哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.55,0:55:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.26,0:55:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师，你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.27,0:55:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.85,0:55:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们究竟是什麽人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.89,0:55:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就说来话长了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.53,0:55:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一定会保护你不让妖怪吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.66,0:55:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.65,0:55:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你放心哆啦A梦一定会护送你到天竺的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.27,0:55:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.40,0:55:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.73,0:55:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万不能回答他
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.78,0:55:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.22,0:55:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答的话你会被吸入他的葫芦里的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.41,0:55:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有……
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.12,0:56:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋，他已经被我吸入葫芦里了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.45,0:56:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我们就有狸猫酒可以喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.39,0:56:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把那个和尚抓回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.47,0:56:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.99,0:56:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点融化吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.27,0:56:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.07,0:56:20.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金角，快把那个葫芦给我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.21,0:56:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要咧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.91,0:56:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非等到那只狸猫融化不然我是不会把葫芦打开的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.72,0:56:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麽可能被融化呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.20,0:56:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是二十二世纪的猫型机器人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.67,0:56:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是搞不清状况
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.44,0:56:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是笨家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.49,0:56:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任意门
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.75,0:56:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开……混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.67,0:56:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要紧吧，阿福
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.34,0:56:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.58,0:56:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经快要被融化了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.94,0:56:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽了大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.98,0:56:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦他被吸入葫芦里了\n怎麽办
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.79,0:56:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗，要不要紧啊\n他怎麽会在葫芦里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.91,0:57:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这点小事你们用不着为我担心
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.84,0:57:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.97,0:57:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什麽时候逃出来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.75,0:57:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金角
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.26,0:57:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什麽？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.90,0:57:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回收成功
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.39,0:57:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来要回收这麽容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.55,0:57:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.86,0:57:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.54,0:57:24.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快走开
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.46,0:57:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁你们还没吃到苦头前\n你们还是快点把唐三藏交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.85,0:57:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把唐三藏交给……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.51,0:57:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银角
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.74,0:57:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我孙悟空来当你的对手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.41,0:57:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛喔\n你不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.96,0:57:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.64,0:57:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.60,0:58:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这麽危险的时候救了我们\n真是非常感谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.61,0:58:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这没什麽这点小事那称得上救呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.41,0:58:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪，你不是那时候的男孩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.43,0:58:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.85,0:58:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.76,0:58:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.87,0:58:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.68,0:58:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.18,0:58:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以那个时候你才会叫我孙悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.92,0:58:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.30,0:58:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这是第一次见到你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.08,0:58:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正以後我们还会有机会见面的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.48,0:58:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.19,0:58:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静，你没受伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.33,0:58:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的动作真是太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.56,0:58:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银角已经被我一个人给打跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.16,0:58:38.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想说因为你是孙悟空吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.81,0:58:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，本孙悟空大人打跑的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.38,0:58:42.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不是因为游戏机的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.97,0:58:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些人为什麽要保护我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.73,0:58:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为这个哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.27,0:58:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出一些莫名其妙的道具\N不是的，那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.52,0:58:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是正好经过的正义使者啦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.01,0:58:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少给我装糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.15,0:59:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来的路程
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.19,0:59:10.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会尽全力保护三藏法师的\n请各位不用操心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.93,0:59:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续你们的旅程吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.22,0:59:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.83,0:59:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.20,0:59:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麽我们要继续赶路了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.26,0:59:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保重\n再见……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.46,0:59:27.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上小心\n要小心一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.29,0:59:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也要小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.46,0:59:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.59,0:59:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样看起来我们的时间和地点都选对了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.93,0:59:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到我可以和三藏法师本人说话\n真是太令人感动了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.51,0:59:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有你不要忘记现在的我是孙悟空喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.53,0:59:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不要忘了这都是虚拟实境游戏机的功劳喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.15,0:59:49.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.62,0:59:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦，我们现在要怎麽办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.21,0:59:58.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须加速前往
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.31,1:00:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将所有的妖怪都收回游戏机里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.54,1:00:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静，你要多辛苦一点继续扮演三藏法师
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.95,1:00:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.53,1:00:09.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，出发
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.48,1:00:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.66,1:00:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.34,1:00:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘记带时光机了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.98,1:00:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思，不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.17,1:00:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害，好厉害的孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.17,1:00:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把出现的妖怪都一网打尽
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.16,1:00:31.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稀里哗啦地击败它们
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.57,1:00:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.50,1:00:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师真的会经过这里面吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.78,1:00:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,历史上是这麽记载的他应该从这里经过的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.71,1:00:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像去游泳喔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.22,1:00:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.67,1:00:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害，好厉害的孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.09,1:00:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当上了主角就这麽得意
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.18,1:00:55.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要降服牛魔王应该就没这麽容易了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.98,1:01:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空非常厉害的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.21,1:01:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.19,1:01:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.73,1:01:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因为你的缘故
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.09,1:01:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害得我们的计画都泡汤了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.24,1:01:20.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的间谍已经到唐三藏身边了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.76,1:01:22.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,间谍？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.06,1:01:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错，间谍
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.06,1:01:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你居然破坏了整个计画
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.29,1:01:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋\n真的很对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.35,1:01:31.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我擅作主张
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.13,1:01:34.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老公，你说怎麽办呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.30,1:01:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎麽处置这个笨蛋呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.93,1:01:40.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请再给我一次将功赎罪的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.32,1:01:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会把唐三藏给抓回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.04,1:02:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.78,1:02:05.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麽不唱歌了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.18,1:02:07.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在哪里还有心情唱歌啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.04,1:02:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.07,1:02:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个沙漠怎麽都走不完啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.72,1:02:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走不动了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.78,1:02:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经没有力气了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.59,1:02:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.04,1:02:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦而且路上连一只妖怪都没看到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.04,1:02:22.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就到此为止吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.09,1:02:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.25,1:02:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦，你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.38,1:02:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种地方怎麽能休息呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.90,1:02:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把软绵绵的床拿来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.38,1:02:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想洗个舒服的澡
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.30,1:02:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要五分熟的牛排
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.60,1:02:37.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要猪排饭就够了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.02,1:02:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真是太奢侈了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.20,1:02:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『露营胶囊』
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.38,1:03:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.78,1:03:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也不夸张
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.00,1:03:06.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还真有精神嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.42,1:03:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要这个房间
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.69,1:03:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我要这边
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.88,1:03:13.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这里好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.84,1:03:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就那边了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.29,1:03:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位，二十分钟後准备用餐
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.19,1:03:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请在大厅的餐桌前集合
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.17,1:03:27.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.93,1:03:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈，我发誓等我打倒妖怪之後\n我一定会马上回家找你的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.69,1:03:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽只有这种睡衣
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.04,1:03:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是伤脑筋
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.28,1:03:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就先凑合凑合吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.83,1:04:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.87,1:04:03.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猪排饭
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.30,1:04:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.72,1:04:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,味道怎麽样啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.14,1:04:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好吃了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.91,1:04:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根妈妈做的菜比起来稍微差一点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.00,1:04:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比我妈妈做的菜好吃多了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.64,1:04:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安你太吵了你吃饭的时候不能小点声吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.45,1:04:25.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃饱了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.32,1:04:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也太快了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.19,1:04:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以在这个享乐吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.97,1:04:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什麽这麽说
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.78,1:04:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为一想到三藏法师他现在正做艰辛的旅行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.76,1:05:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就要进入沙漠地区了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.33,1:05:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那会很艰苦的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.72,1:05:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经有所觉悟了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.20,1:05:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天晚上就好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.64,1:05:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.76,1:05:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.89,1:05:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.27,1:05:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了小心起见还是把危险报警员放着好了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.06,1:05:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我就能安心睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.51,1:06:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.77,1:06:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麽还不睡啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.26,1:06:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静你也一样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.78,1:06:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我从来没有见过这麽美丽的星空
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.43,1:06:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是没错\n可是在这个星空下
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.48,1:06:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想妖怪也躲在某个角落吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.59,1:06:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.29,1:06:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.40,1:06:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定孙悟空……
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.48,1:06:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是虚构的人物
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.92,1:06:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空一定就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.57,1:06:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎麽可能
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.79,1:06:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死人了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.08,1:06:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天又还没亮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.09,1:07:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那接下来就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.14,1:08:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南无阿弥陀佛……
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.00,1:08:31.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要做什麽
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.51,1:08:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.38,1:09:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，出发
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.90,1:09:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.74,1:09:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是来这里睡觉的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.15,1:09:37.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发了，出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.19,1:09:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在时间还早嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.09,1:09:41.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪们也一定还在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.77,1:09:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.37,1:09:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果让三藏法师赶到我们前面就不好了\n真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.19,1:09:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是孙悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.02,1:09:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就搭乘你的筋斗云先到附件去探查一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.55,1:09:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.36,1:09:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,筋斗云
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.55,1:09:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这个时候
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.18,1:10:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们才会把我当成孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.49,1:10:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.56,1:10:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放眼望去都是沙漠嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.95,1:10:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好热喔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.80,1:10:36.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.40,1:10:54.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师……
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.62,1:10:56.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水……我要喝水
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.15,1:10:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是三藏法师
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.04,1:11:06.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里一定就是绿洲了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.08,1:11:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先休息一下再走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.37,1:11:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麽
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.40,1:11:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不该会是……
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.31,1:11:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火焰山吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.30,1:11:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪们一定都住在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.11,1:11:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道可不可以进得去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.67,1:11:54.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛……烫死我了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.89,1:11:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行不通根本无法靠近
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.79,1:12:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，好像有个东西可以熄灭这个火
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.75,1:12:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答对了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.50,1:12:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要用我的芭蕉扇一挥就可以熄灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.17,1:12:11.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是铁扇公主了快点把芭蕉扇交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.15,1:12:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎麽可能交给你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.03,1:12:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦……
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.40,1:12:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄到底跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.90,1:12:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是捧他几句就飞上天了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.24,1:12:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊，他未免太得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.71,1:12:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.25,1:12:46.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你终於出现了，银角
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.47,1:12:50.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来找你们替金角报仇了\n你们要有所觉悟
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.17,1:12:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会把你打的落花流水的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.08,1:12:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.78,1:12:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是三藏法师吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.80,1:12:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们只要乖乖把他交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.26,1:13:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就答应放你们一条生路
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.10,1:13:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要开玩笑了\n我们绝对不会让你带走他的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.24,1:13:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想尝到苦头吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.75,1:13:06.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的\n好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.65,1:13:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.81,1:13:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.19,1:13:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦，快想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.19,1:13:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等，冷……
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.22,1:13:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静一点
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.37,1:13:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.58,1:13:24.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉悟吧……你这个家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.47,1:13:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.48,1:13:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银角
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.40,1:13:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什……
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.17,1:13:33.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个把戏……
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.58,1:13:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不会上当的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.10,1:13:39.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖地把唐三藏交出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.98,1:13:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.87,1:13:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽样，认输了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.95,1:13:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安够了，放过他吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.42,1:13:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什麽
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.56,1:13:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们敌不过他们的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.93,1:14:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可不可以商量一下呢,银角
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.59,1:14:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,商量什麽？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.86,1:14:15.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我啊\n技安
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.23,1:14:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧吧，技安
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.71,1:14:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回收成功
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.79,1:14:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.41,1:14:26.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，哆啦A梦真聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.02,1:14:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就说你怎麽变了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.10,1:14:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动脑筋的地方就包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.69,1:14:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过又收服了一个真是太令人高兴了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.01,1:14:44.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是啊，宜静
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.68,1:14:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.14,1:14:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静，奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.71,1:14:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽回事呢 宜静
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.76,1:14:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静，奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.99,1:14:54.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.02,1:14:55.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.31,1:14:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不见了\n宜静
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.94,1:15:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.73,1:15:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定在我们不注意的时候被抓走了\n快去找她
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.11,1:15:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道往哪个方向去了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.84,1:15:12.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是那边吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.49,1:15:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，我们去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.06,1:15:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.72,1:15:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们慢吞吞地在做什麽\n通通给我退下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.20,1:15:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.50,1:16:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.42,1:16:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.73,1:16:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是你啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.43,1:16:25.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麽一个人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.96,1:16:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.78,1:16:29.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个……
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.76,1:16:31.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.59,1:16:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什麽
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.93,1:16:35.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师被妖怪抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.63,1:16:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.39,1:16:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是说过一切没问题的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.77,1:16:48.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是大雄吗\n真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.26,1:16:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.72,1:16:51.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.26,1:16:56.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂~
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.37,1:17:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，事情不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.71,1:17:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静也被抓了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.40,1:17:05.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽，三藏法师也被抓了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.12,1:17:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因为你动作慢才会这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.32,1:17:10.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁叫我先去探查敌情的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.28,1:17:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你就不能早点回来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.18,1:17:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，这都你害的啦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.05,1:17:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，不要再吵了先把他们救出来再说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.47,1:17:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是火焰山\n妖怪们好像都住在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.00,1:17:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然这里的火焰很大不过感觉倒不是那麽热
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.90,1:17:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有一般以上的火焰是假像
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.89,1:17:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静和三藏法师一定都被抓到里面去了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.06,1:17:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有可怕的牛魔王也在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.23,1:17:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是妖怪里的大魔王吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.05,1:17:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.22,1:18:01.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要能打败他的话其他妖怪的法力就会消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.96,1:18:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们要怎麽样才能抓到他呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.52,1:18:06.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之，我们先进去那里再计画吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.75,1:18:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们有铁扇公主的芭蕉扇的话
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.07,1:18:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以轻易把这些火焰煽灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.88,1:18:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有什麽好法子啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.15,1:18:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们继续待在这里的话
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.53,1:18:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们两个人一定会被妖怪吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.66,1:18:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，就试试那个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.86,1:18:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『云雨制造机』
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.36,1:18:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像靠不住的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.22,1:18:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东西是要试过了才知道\n没试过你怎麽知道靠不住呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.24,1:18:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.50,1:18:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了，继续下雨吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.60,1:18:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是火焰一点也没有减少的迹象
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.38,1:18:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失败了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.55,1:18:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那根本就不是普通的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.27,1:19:00.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.08,1:19:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里好像有入口
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.80,1:19:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.90,1:19:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那块石头的右边
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.33,1:19:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.78,1:19:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\n我们就进去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.75,1:19:16.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.40,1:19:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定就是入口没有错了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.54,1:19:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到这个地方会有入口
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.58,1:19:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个火焰很猛烈耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.42,1:19:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来怎麽办
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.08,1:19:37.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽办
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.03,1:19:40.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好了，我们直接闯进去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.89,1:19:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.51,1:19:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里面跟外面那些假像的火焰是不一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.78,1:19:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硬闯的话就一定会被抓住的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.99,1:19:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位，请跟在我後面吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.46,1:19:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.66,1:20:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁他们没有发现之前快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.81,1:20:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下来
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.92,1:20:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,踩到那个的话，後果可不堪设想
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.13,1:20:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可要仔细看好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.80,1:20:26.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後退
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.02,1:20:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里到处都有这种陷阱
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.85,1:20:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要碰到墙壁
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.21,1:20:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.28,1:20:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.84,1:20:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对这里面的情形为什麽会这麽清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.66,1:21:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，他居然会这麽清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.50,1:21:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人怀疑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.25,1:21:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这座城堡是建立在岩浆上面的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.32,1:21:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.27,1:21:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕\n小杨
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.39,1:21:56.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我，不是我害你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.46,1:21:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做得很好，红孩儿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.59,1:22:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.45,1:22:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜静，宜静
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.39,1:22:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家都平安无事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.39,1:22:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋，这哪叫平安无事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.69,1:22:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你仔细看清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.76,1:22:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小杨，你这个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.63,1:22:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,处心积虑地居然连三藏法师也给骗了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.07,1:22:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.51,1:22:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从一开始就知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.33,1:22:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是妖怪只要是愿意陪我走这段旅行的人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.84,1:22:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不会拒绝他的因为他一定知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.64,1:22:42.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这段旅途的目的是什麽
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.68,1:22:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太遗憾了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.43,1:22:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你永远到达不了目的地的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.54,1:22:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点让我吃了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.73,1:22:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛魔王
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.20,1:22:57.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，马上来了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.84,1:22:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点准备上菜
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.53,1:23:12.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\n我不要
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.44,1:23:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.31,1:23:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定把你做成牛肉饭的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.64,1:23:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先从那只肥胖的蓝色狸猫开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.34,1:23:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是狸猫
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.31,1:23:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是机器人啊就算把我煮熟了\n也不好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.28,1:23:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.08,1:23:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊\n小杨，你要干什麽
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.93,1:23:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.07,1:23:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点住手，牛魔王
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.61,1:23:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观世音菩萨
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.85,1:23:45.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来救你了，哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.90,1:23:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.37,1:23:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这时光机未免也太华丽了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.82,1:23:54.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也没有办法啊\n我可花了好长的时间才找到你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.29,1:23:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你，哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.30,1:23:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这小家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.36,1:23:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然敢打扰我用餐
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.95,1:24:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等，我来当你的对手
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.42,1:24:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空，你什麽时候逃掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.96,1:24:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦，原来你认识我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.01,1:24:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄\n大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.22,1:24:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人撑得住吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.31,1:24:12.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什麽时候跑掉的\n你们也快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.61,1:24:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.56,1:24:26.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄\n大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.90,1:24:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口在这边，快点\n大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.19,1:24:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.00,1:24:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你要加油啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.76,1:24:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你们走出这里的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.61,1:24:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个叛徒
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.47,1:24:48.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.52,1:24:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你放过他们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.11,1:24:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麽
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.51,1:24:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛魔王
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.37,1:24:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿牛
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.19,1:25:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了！大雄，振作一点
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.59,1:25:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点逃出这里吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.79,1:25:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我……
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.10,1:25:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空，你受死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.18,1:25:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如意棒变大吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.05,1:25:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老公
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.88,1:25:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.89,1:25:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你打败牛魔王了\n这样一来，所有的妖怪都会失去法力
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.07,1:25:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.41,1:25:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好厉害喔，大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.00,1:25:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.89,1:25:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点，火山要爆发了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.14,1:26:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快点往外逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.37,1:26:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该是来不及了现在该怎麽办才好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.61,1:26:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥你冷静一点嘛你不是有任意门吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.15,1:26:18.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.32,1:26:20.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我差点忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.47,1:26:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.38,1:27:16.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一二一……
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.65,1:27:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样火山就不会继续延烧下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.97,1:27:20.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终於结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.15,1:27:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过三藏法师的旅行还是要继续走下去的\n而且还要好多年呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.91,1:27:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.52,1:27:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我给大家带来这麽多麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.60,1:27:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要这麽说
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.56,1:27:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实一开始都是我的疏忽造成的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.54,1:27:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.97,1:27:44.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法师\n都是我给您带来这些麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.59,1:27:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这麽说，我从来这里面也学到了许多事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.75,1:27:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.11,1:27:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以後就请把小杨交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.95,1:27:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.39,1:27:55.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是啊，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.46,1:27:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很对不起一直不断给你添这麽多麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.31,1:28:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要加油喔，小杨
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.55,1:28:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你，孙悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.37,1:28:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我真正的名字是……
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.28,1:28:10.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是孙悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.35,1:28:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，我就是齐天大圣孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.42,1:28:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你的，孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.94,1:28:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见……
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.88,1:28:28.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油喔
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.22,1:28:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见……
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.80,1:28:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也回去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.72,1:28:31.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.32,1:28:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的世界真的变回原来的样子了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.91,1:28:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心啦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.71,1:28:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈，我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.67,1:28:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这麽晚你到底跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.31,1:28:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道没恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.43,1:28:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.82,1:28:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家怎麽了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.38,1:29:00.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有角
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.84,1:29:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.93,1:29:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽了，大雄\n妈妈……
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.77,1:29:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.54,1:29:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼睛说 想对远方 燃烧着的晚霞说话
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.05,1:29:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的嘴唇说 想对 陌生人说话
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.41,1:29:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的脚说 想追上 流逝的云
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.72,1:29:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 去旅行 去旅行
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.37,1:29:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的鞋说 想走地图上没有的道路
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.62,1:29:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手指说 想摘下 美丽的花朵
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.01,1:30:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以名为 明天的城市 作为目标
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.25,1:30:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Go to the west
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.47,1:30:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以名为 明天的城市 作为目标
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.46,1:30:49.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中国四千年历史之谜
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.16,1:30:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们即将全力以赴解开这个谜
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.83,1:30:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西游记
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.19,1:30:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.35,1:31:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的平行西游记
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.75,1:31:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有玄奘法师这个人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.68,1:31:09.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空很可能就是大雄你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.80,1:31:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.28,1:31:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄！跟真的大雄长得一模一样
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.60,1:31:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什麽时候变得这麽厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.94,1:31:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦\n大雄的平行西游记
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.86,1:31:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了……是蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.45,1:31:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙悟空？你又说谎了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.38,1:31:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.87,1:31:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定就是真正的孙悟空了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.50,1:31:42.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨~
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.93,1:31:48.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了解救受妖怪们统治的世界我们决定挺身而出
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.61,1:31:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.81,1:31:52.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的平行西游记
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.85,1:31:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会在电影院等你们的
